  "statement": "Compute\n\n\\[\\left\\lfloor\\frac{2007!+2004!}{2006!+2005!}\\right\\rfloor\\]\n\n(Note that \\(\\lfloor x\\rfloor\\) denotes the greatest integer less than or equal to \\(x\\).)",
  "answerChoices": [],
